            "description": "__Height:__ 180 cm\n\nDae-Wi is one of the main protagonists in The God Of Highschool. He was once part of the legendary duo named 'Mad Cows' and he is a very skilled fighter. Over time, he will become a close friend of [Mo-Ri](https://anilist.co/character/124136/Jin-Mo-Ri) and [Mi-Ra](https://anilist.co/character/153293/Yu-Mi-Ra). He is a practitioner of the Kyokushin Karate (Full Contact Karate).\n\n ~!After training from Executive Q Dae-Wi is able to summon the charyeok Haetae!~"
