            "name_native": "박일표",
            "name_alternative": [],
            "description": "Park Ilpyo is the Meridional Jeolla Province Champion of the G.O.H Tournament. He is considered as one of the top 3 fighters in the country and is famously known as Sakyamuni Park Ilpyo. He is one of the main supporting characters of the series.\n\n__After RagnarÖk__ ~!17 years after RagnarÖk, he becomes one of The Six and devoted himself to teaching Ssam-Su Taekkyeon.!~ \n__CHARYEOK__ ~!Nine-Tails Guardian: This is the Charyeok of Park Il-Pyo. It is currently the only Charyeok that changes the appearance of its user, besides Yu Mi-Ra's Yeo-Po Bong-Seon. It is one of the most powerful Charyeok seen to date it has been seen taking down multiple Charyeok in Greed's arsenal. The Nine-Tails Guardian is seen to give the wielder health generation, physical enhancements including enhanced strength and speed, and pyrokenesis.!~"
